Z||000021||mrfixit58||02-14-2000||05:22 PM||||Monkeyman,<P>That was my post you commented on about the "Waiting.." and "Still waiting...". And, I was not in the least offended. I was more upset that I could not use Cliff's PIP because of a firewall.<P>To tell you the truth, I thought all Fiero-ites had thick skin! The way we're treated... you know, like a red-headed step child (no offence to anyone who's red-headed... some of my favorite people are red-headed... like my wife... and my brother... and a couple on neices... so.. no flames... please?).<P>And, I kinda got used to that one fingered salute every time I squeezed that little Fiero of mine in between two cars where that driver, who was now behind me, thought he was already tailgating... well... let's just say I got used to seeing it in my rear view mirror.<P>Anyway, welcome back,<BR>Roy L.<BR>||||reg||14
