Z||000037||fierospeeder||02-14-2000||10:56 PM||||Im happy that your back, i have always liked your remarks and ideas in this forum.  I enjoyed your dry sense of humor and people say i have the same characteristic.  I have been on aol in the chatrooms and i know how some people are.  A lot of people hated me in the chats and also liked me.  I presented myself as a type of a mancow character and a few members disliked it.  The people that tried to harass me for years didn't work because i know they are not getting anywhere.  Im not on aol any longer but i know theres still people that think im on there and their obsession to get back at me.  They are just losers that have no real lives, and to hear you say that some idiot scanned his middle finger, means he has nothing better to do.  The people that do these things have personality problems and i hope they realize that.  Also look out for yourself in real life because people are the same offline, ive been backstabbed at my dads work ,im a college student making some money during vacation, and another kid quit so he blamed me for harassment because he was to lazy to work 40 hours a week.  This was in a machine shop where us "guys" are vulgar all the time, if this kid showed up he would have gotten his ass kicked because he was to much of a coward to say he wanted to work 10 hours at Mc donalds.  All the guys told me your learning at a young age, and people are jealous.  Monkey, society is this way.  We are advancing as people, i guess.<BR>||||reg||1
